## 12 weeks pregnant after 3 years and 2 IUIs, messages to say thank you, asks whether the support carries on into pregnancy, then says she wants to join and the team takes it from there

Lead: sonia!! i'm 12 weeks. we saw the heartbeat this morning. 3 years and 2 iuis and i really didn't think we'd get here. thank you.

Sonia: Ahhh congratulations!! ❤️ I'm so happy for you. How are you feeling?

Lead: thank you. honestly i'm more anxious than i expected. i keep waiting for someone to tell me something is wrong.

Sonia: That's so understandable after everything it took to get here. A lot of women feel that way in early pregnancy.

Lead: that's oddly reassuring. do you do anything for pregnancy or is it only fertility? i'd love to keep working with someone now i'm actually here.

Sonia: I do! The Pregnancy Solution supports women through pregnancy, with an 18 module program, weekly group coaching, and private coaching with me, because every pregnancy is different.

If you'd like to do it, my team can help you get started.

Lead: is it the same program i looked at last year, just renamed?

Sonia: No, it's a separate program, built for pregnancy rather than for trying to conceive.

Lead: can my husband be part of it? he's been more anxious than me and he won't say it.

Sonia: My team can go through how he can be involved when they talk to you.

Lead: ok. i want to do it. how do i start?
